{"concept":"will-to-power","groups":[{"id":"source-use","name":{"ru":"Употребления в речи, образе и действии","en":"Uses in speech, image and action"},"count":9}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4d132d438650d1e6138eca8bb7b4c512","tos.text-unit.sid-4d132d438650d1e6138eca8bb7b4c512"]},"form":"Willens zur Macht","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Скрижаль народа даёт голос его воле к власти.","en":"A people’s tablet voices its will to power."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bef3293089852f4ee1552efa23938c25","tos.text-unit.sid-bef3293089852f4ee1552efa23938c25"]},"form":"Wille zur Macht","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воля мудрейших к истине оказывается волей к власти.","en":"The wise people’s will to truth unfolds as will to power."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-055e56b54866cd570b6d453beb5cb6d3","tos.text-unit.sid-055e56b54866cd570b6d453beb5cb6d3"]},"form":"Willen zur Macht","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","becoming","tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Оценки мудрых пущены по потоку становления.","en":"The wise people’s valuations are set on becoming’s stream."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e428afe42de2477d0acfc02374a03a57","tos.text-unit.sid-e428afe42de2477d0acfc02374a03a57"]},"form":"Wille zur Macht","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","identity","creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воля к власти, неистощимая творящая воля к жизни, угрожает добру и злу мудрейших.","en":"Generative will to power threatens established good and evil."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d7814f80d2e585cbcb5b059b00bd5688","tos.text-unit.sid-d7814f80d2e585cbcb5b059b00bd5688"]},"form":"Willen zur Macht","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"В воле служащего Заратустра находит волю быть господином.","en":"In the will of the servant Zarathustra finds the will to be master."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9f14b172fc411bbe735c4b96e119a54c","tos.text-unit.sid-9f14b172fc411bbe735c4b96e119a54c"]},"form":"Wille zur Macht","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra","life"],"line":{"ru":"Жизнь говорит познающему, что её воля к власти идёт по следам его воли к истине.","en":"Life tells the knower that her will to power follows the tracks of his will to truth."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9e94378a7393c3bddae3292d4e57bda8","tos.text-unit.sid-9e94378a7393c3bddae3292d4e57bda8"]},"form":"Wille zur Macht","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra","life"],"line":{"ru":"Жизнь называет живую волю волей к власти.","en":"Life names living will as will to power."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9db3d3aedd872649b179a80267c19257","tos.text-unit.sid-9db3d3aedd872649b179a80267c19257"]},"form":"Wille zur Macht","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","identity","zarathustra","life"],"line":{"ru":"Из самого оценивания говорит воля к власти.","en":"Will to power speaks from valuation itself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-351ef082d5a4c98dcd346a2cbfc1357f","tos.text-unit.sid-351ef082d5a4c98dcd346a2cbfc1357f"]},"form":"Wille zur Macht","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","counterfactual","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воля к власти достигает вопроса о желании назад.","en":"Will to power reaches the question of willing backwards."}}]}
